@startuml
title Courier status and asynchronous notifications — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|Flutter Courier|
start
:Send status or proof completion with version/key;
|Delivery API|
if (Role, current assignment, version and transition valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :401/403/404/409; no state change;
  stop
endif
if (Completing Delivered?) then (yes)
  :Validate required proof and stage private object;
  if (Storage confirmed?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :503; state unchanged;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Attempt atomic versioned status + history + StatusChanged outbox transaction;
if (Commit succeeds?) then (yes)
  :Return 200 committed state;
else (no)
  :409; leave staged object for orphan cleanup;
  stop
endif
|Delivery outbox relay|
:Publish after commit; retry until broker confirmation;
fork
  |Notification Worker|
  :Deduplicate event and resolve minimum recipient IDs;
  :Commit inbox + unique notification/provider/dispatch jobs;
  :ACK broker after commit;
  :Persist in-app update; send mock provider notification;
  if (Merchant-originated parcel?) then (yes)
    :Call Merchant DispatchWebhook with service JWT;
    |Merchant API|
    :Persist unique subscription jobs;
    :Validate destination, decrypt key, fresh timestamp/HMAC;
    :Send HTTPS; persist attempt and scheduled retries;
  endif
fork again
  |Delivery realtime consumer|
  :Read latest DB version;
  :Recheck viewer authorization;
  :Send SSE snapshot; reconnect refetches current state;
end fork
stop
@enduml
